h" "\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{4}-{e}^{-4})"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95590" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{4}+{e}^{-4})"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342240" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that $z>0,$ simplify $\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(3\\operatorname{ln}⁡{z}^{2})$ using the definition of the hyperbolic cosine.\n\n$\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(3\\operatorname{ln}⁡{z}^{2})=\\frac{1}{2}({z}^{6}\\,+$ {{field-1}} $)$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342240" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x$ is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(3\\operatorname{ln}⁡{z}^{2}) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡{z}^{2}}+{e}^{-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡{z}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({z}^{2})^{3}}+{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({z}^{2})^{-3}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({z}^{6})}+{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({z}^{-6})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({z}^{6}+{z}^{-6}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342240" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "addfc6251a968bc7c4488071b4d57376291c909cf447db1412fb6e079f56fc56"} {"question" "q-342240" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342240" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "z^{-6}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate $\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1/3)).$ **Do not round** your answer.\n\n$\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1/3))=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x$ is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1/3)) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1/3)}+{e}^{-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1/3)}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1/3)}+{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{3}+3) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1+9}{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "addfc6251a968bc7c4488071b4d57376291c909cf447db1412fb6e079f56fc56"} {"question" "q-342231" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342231" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{5}{3}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95493" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that $y\\ge 0,$ which of the following is equivalent to $\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\sqrt{y}?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95493" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\sqrt{y})=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{y}}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{y}}).\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95493" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "addfc6251a968bc7c4488071b4d57376291c909cf447db1412fb6e079f56fc56"} {"question" "q-95493" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95493" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2({e}^{\\sqrt{y}}+{e}^{-\\sqrt{y}})"] ["math" "2({e}^{\\sqrt{y}}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{y}})"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{-\\sqrt{y}}-{e}^{\\sqrt{y}})"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{y}}+{e}^{-\\sqrt{y}})"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{y}}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{y}})"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95493" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{y}}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{y}})"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-125355" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that $t>0,$ which of the following is equivalent to $\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡{t}^{3})?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-125355" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡{t}^{3}) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{3})}-{e}^{-\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{3})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{3})}-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(({t}^{3})^{-1})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{3})}-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{-3})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({t}^{3}-{t}^{-3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{{t}^{6}-1}{{t}^{3}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{t}^{6}-1}{2{t}^{3}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-125355" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "addfc6251a968bc7c4488071b4d57376291c909cf447db1412fb6e079f56fc56"} {"question" "q-125355" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json