" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x & =\\frac{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}{{e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{-2x}}{1+{e}^{-2x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the third definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4) & =\\frac{1-{e}^{-2(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4)}}{1+{e}^{-2(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}}{1+{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{4}^{2}}}{1+{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡16}}{1+{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡16}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-16}{1+16} \\\\  & =-\\frac{15}{17}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342671" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "addfc6251a968bc7c4488071b4d57376291c909cf447db1412fb6e079f56fc56"} {"question" "q-342671" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342671" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{15}{17}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342669" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate $tanh\\,(-\\frac{3}{4}).$ **Do not round** your answer.\n\n$tanh\\,(-\\frac{3}{4})=$\n\n| {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n| $1+{e}^{3/2}$ |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342669" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x & =\\frac{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}{{e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{-2x}}{1+{e}^{-2x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the third definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}tanh\\,(-\\frac{3}{4}) & =\\frac{1-{e}^{-2(-3/4)}}{1+{e}^{-2(-3/4)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{3/2}}{1+{e}^{3/2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342669" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "addfc6251a968bc7c4488071b4d57376291c909cf447db1412fb6e079f56fc56"} {"question" "q-342669" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-342669" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1-e^{3/2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95597" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Which of the following is equivalent to  $\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(-\\frac{1}{w})?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95597" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x & =\\frac{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}{{e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{-2x}}{1+{e}^{-2x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the third definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(-\\frac{1}{w}) & =\\frac{1-{e}^{-2(-1/w)}}{1+{e}^{-2(-1/w)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{2/w}}{1+{e}^{2/w}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95597" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "addfc6251a968bc7c4488071b4d57376291c909cf447db1412fb6e079f56fc56"} {"question" "q-95597" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95597" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1+{e}^{2/w}}{1-{e}^{2/w}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1+{e}^{2w}}{1-{e}^{2w}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1-2{e}^{1/w}}{1+2{e}^{1/w}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1-{e}^{2/w}}{1+{e}^{2/w}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1-{e}^{2w}}{1+{e}^{2w}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "q-95597" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1-{e}^{2/w}}{1+{e}^{2/w}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/state.json" "file_sha256" "512ed2c0d0f9c837f349c2dd836e5e4eec29b9f91c8dccd8a236b40b4ee2f6ac"} {"question" "e-8383" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate $\\cosh  (\\ln 2).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/example-8383.json" "file_sha256" "c42b926ca45100b1ec458ed589df8a6f28075f47f6809b86455b027df6a7a364"} {"question" "e-8383" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\cosh{x}$ is\n\n$$\n\\cosh{x} = \\dfrac{1}{2}(e^{x} + e^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡2) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}+{e}^{-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}+{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{2}^{-1}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(2+{2}^{-1}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(2+\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{4+1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/example-8383.json" "file_sha256" "c42b926ca45100b1ec458ed589df8a6f28075f47f6809b86455b027df6a7a364"} {"question" "e-8738" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate $\\sinh 1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/example-8738.json" "file_sha256" "426599907f352dd93430e82d8c7fc253d8598a80e73f13c686e8e8d21755b5da"} {"question" "e-8738" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\sinh x$ is \n\n$$\n\\sinh{x} = \\dfrac{1}{2}(e^{x} - e^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡1 & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{1}-{e}^{-1}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(e-\\frac{1}{e}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{{e}^{2}-1}{e}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2}-1}{2e}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/example-8738.json" "file_sha256" "426599907f352dd93430e82d8c7fc253d8598a80e73f13c686e8e8d21755b5da"} {"question" "e-8384" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate $\\tanh{4}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/example-8384.json" "file_sha256" "e0b663cc000be7ced6c46f4699395432707e4b2f855bae7871c4fde31dd96906"} {"question" "e-8384" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The definition of $\\tanh x$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x & =\\frac{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}{{e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{-2x}}{1+{e}^{-2x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the second definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡4 & =\\frac{{e}^{2(4)}-1}{{e}^{2(4)}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{8}-1}{{e}^{8}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077555/example-8384.json" "file_sha256" "e0b663cc000be7ced6c46f4699395432707e4b2f855bae7871c4fde31dd96906"}] "usage" {"e-8383" [] "e-8738" [] "e-8384" [] "q-9446" []} "basis" 2801 "retractions" [[17592186092862 :question/problem "What is $\\sinh (\\ln \\sqrt{2})$?"] [17592186092079 :question/problem "Evaluate $\\cosh (\\ln 2)$."] [17592186092079 :question/worked-solution "The definition of $\\cosh{x}$ is\n\n$$\n\\cosh{x} = \\dfrac{1}{2}(e^{x} + e^{-x})\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cosh (\\ln 2) &= \\frac{1}{2}(e^{\\ln 2} + e^{-\\ln 2}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}(e^{\\ln 2} + e^{\\ln 2^{-1}}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}(2 + 2^{-1}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}(2 + \\frac{1}{2}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{4 + 1}{2}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{5}{4}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186092084 :question/problem "Evaluate $\\sinh 1$."] [17592186092084 :question/worked-solution "The definition of $\\sinh x$ is\n\n$$\n\\sinh{x} = \\dfrac{1}{2}(e^{x} - e^{-x})\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sinh 1 &= \\frac{1}{2}(e^{1} - e^{-1}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}(e - \\frac{1}{e}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{e^{2} - 1}{e}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{e^{2} - 1}{2e}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186092080 :question/problem "Evaluate $\\tanh{4}$."] [17592186092080 :question/worked-solution "The definition of $\\tanh x$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tanh x &= \\frac{e^{x} - e^{-x}}{e^{x} + e^{-x}} \\\\\n&= \\frac{e^{2x} - 1}{e^{2x} + 1} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1 - e^{-2x}}{1 + e^{-2x}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the second definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tanh 4 &= (e^{2(4)} - 1)/(e^{2(4)} + 1) \\\\\n&= \\frac{e^{8} - 1}{e^{8} + 1}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186091638 17592186091639 17592186091640 17592186091641 17592186091642] "immutable_fields" [[17592186091637 :answer-field/correct] [17592186091637 :answer-field/id] [17592186091637 :answer-field/key] [17592186091637 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
